# Per-run support artifacts. These hold customer names, email addresses and
# account state, so they stay on the machine that produced them and out of the
# history. Nothing reads them across machines: the triage ledgers only need to
# survive between runs on the same box, and pending SQL is written for a human
# to run once and discard.
